WEBVTT

00:01.920 --> 00:04.760
<i>"It's normal to be mean to your crush."</i>

00:05.300 --> 00:10.680
<i>I don't know how long this theory has been</i>
<i>treated as a completely plausible fact,</i>

00:10.760 --> 00:14.310
<i>but from my perspective,</i>
<i>at least, it's a flat-out lie.</i>

00:15.100 --> 00:17.020
<i>If you think about it logically,</i>

00:17.100 --> 00:19.940
<i>it makes way more sense to be nice</i>
<i>to someone you have feelings for.</i>

00:20.400 --> 00:23.400
<i>At least that's what I,</i>
<i>a stickler for efficiency, believe.</i>

00:26.360 --> 00:29.910
<i>When your bully's actually in love</i>
<i>with you, that contrast is a turn-on?</i>

00:31.780 --> 00:32.830
<i>That's so dumb.</i>

00:33.830 --> 00:38.500
<i>If you were trying to fight strategically</i>
<i>and efficiently for your love,</i>

00:38.580 --> 00:41.210
<i>you'd never be mean to them for no reason.</i>

00:55.850 --> 00:57.140
Too loud!

00:57.220 --> 00:59.640
Why are you blasting this crap
to the whole building?!

01:03.860 --> 01:06.030
Oh, hey, Senpai!

01:06.110 --> 01:09.490
You should really knock before
barging into someone's room, you know.

01:09.570 --> 01:11.240
This is <i>my</i> room.

01:11.660 --> 01:15.080
Anyway, keep the volume down.
You'll bother the other residents.

01:15.950 --> 01:18.370
I mean, are those headphones just for show?

01:18.450 --> 01:21.580
Oh, you're asking why I wear these?

01:22.040 --> 01:24.460
You really wanna go there?

01:24.540 --> 01:29.420
The reason's so core to my character,
it'd put you on my route if this were a game.

01:29.670 --> 01:33.140
Wow, you wanna conquer me that badly, huh?

01:33.220 --> 01:34.930
Guess I have no choice, then.

01:35.050 --> 01:36.220
Actually, I couldn't care less.

01:36.310 --> 01:40.600
Oh, snap! That came straight from the heart!
We got a real stone-cold operator here!

01:40.690 --> 01:41.730
<i>Make her stop.</i>

01:41.810 --> 01:46.320
But you know, Senpai,
you should've anticipated I'd be here.

01:46.400 --> 01:49.070
What if I'd been in the middle of changing?

01:49.780 --> 01:51.740
Or is that what you were hoping for?!

01:51.820 --> 01:53.360
Officer! Help!

01:53.450 --> 01:55.950
Sure, call the police, you trespasser.

01:56.080 --> 01:57.950
In fact, why don't I call them for you?

01:58.080 --> 02:01.540
Oh? You think they'll take
your word over mine in court?

02:02.830 --> 02:05.290
<i>This girl, Kohinata Iroha,</i>

02:05.330 --> 02:09.510
<i>is a creature who isn't happy unless she</i>
<i>can assert dominance over me at all times.</i>

02:12.720 --> 02:16.930
Also, calling me a trespasser is so mean.

02:22.430 --> 02:26.440
I have clear proof that you've consented
to my being here, after all.

02:26.520 --> 02:29.360
That's not why I gave you that key!

02:29.440 --> 02:31.320
I bet, after you kick me out,

02:31.650 --> 02:37.700
you're gonna bury your face in this bed
soaked with my scent and breathe it in, right?

02:37.780 --> 02:39.330
I <i>know</i> you will.

02:39.580 --> 02:40.870
Like hell I will.

02:42.790 --> 02:46.170
Not even 1% of your scent is sticking
around if I have any say in it.

02:46.250 --> 02:48.710
Hey! Don't just spray me like that! Rude!

02:49.050 --> 02:51.010
If you don't want me to do it again,

02:51.090 --> 02:53.630
you'd best settle down and
go back to your own room.

02:54.130 --> 02:56.590
Is this how you treat your baby sis?!

02:56.680 --> 02:58.640
You're literally not my sister.

02:58.720 --> 03:02.270
I'm your friend's little sister,
so I'm your sister in spirit.

03:02.350 --> 03:04.560
Or SIS for short!

03:04.980 --> 03:08.020
Uh, no. All that makes you is a stranger.

03:08.270 --> 03:12.900
Wait! If you and my brother got married,
I'd officially be your sister!

03:12.990 --> 03:14.030
Don't get weird ideas.

03:15.110 --> 03:18.700
You're so cute when you're
being teased, Senpai!

03:20.490 --> 03:22.200
<i>This little brat...</i>

03:24.710 --> 03:27.210
PRESIDENT TSUKINOMORI
- Hey. I have an important call to take.

03:27.500 --> 03:29.090
Either get out right now, or...

03:29.210 --> 03:31.340
Okay! I'll be quiet!

03:32.170 --> 03:33.840
You get what's at stake here, right?

03:33.920 --> 03:34.920
Yes, sir!

04:06.620 --> 04:12.250
MY FRIEND'S LITTLE SISTER HAS IT IN FOR ME!

05:12.480 --> 05:18.070
<i>Honeyplace Works, or "HPW" for short,</i>
<i>is a major entertainment company.</i>

05:18.360 --> 05:21.990
Well, hey! It's been a long time, Akiteru-kun!

05:22.280 --> 05:23.950
President Tsukinomori.

05:24.030 --> 05:26.910
<i>Come on. Don't act like you</i>
<i>haven't known me all your life.</i>

05:27.290 --> 05:29.250
You'll make your uncle cry.

05:29.870 --> 05:33.500
Are you contacting me about
my employment application?

05:33.580 --> 05:37.760
<i>Yeah. Your bold request to join the company</i>
<i>without taking our exam has shown me</i>

05:37.840 --> 05:42.010
<i>that you don't understand crap about</i>
<i>what it takes to make it in this society.</i>

05:42.470 --> 05:45.600
So... You can't do it after all, then?

05:45.850 --> 05:48.350
<i>- I never said that.</i>
- Then—

05:48.430 --> 05:51.940
<i>I'm willing to do a favor for my beloved nephew.</i>

05:52.440 --> 05:55.190
<i>But I'll need you to agree to certain terms.</i>

05:56.730 --> 05:58.940
The first condition is...

06:00.780 --> 06:02.570
<i>Akiteru-kun, you...</i>

06:04.820 --> 06:07.660
<i>don't have a girlfriend or anything, do you?</i>

06:07.740 --> 06:08.790
Huh?

06:14.170 --> 06:16.380
<i>Hang on! What are you plotting?!</i>

06:16.460 --> 06:17.630
<i>Just get out of here!</i>

06:18.000 --> 06:19.460
Senpai!

06:19.550 --> 06:21.340
Get off me, you idiot!

06:21.420 --> 06:22.720
Meow!

06:22.800 --> 06:24.050
<i>Is someone there with you?</i>

06:24.140 --> 06:26.140
Actually, I just got a cat recently.

06:26.220 --> 06:28.180
<i>Oh, nice! What kind?</i>

06:28.260 --> 06:31.600
<i>Shit! I don't know anything about cat breeds!</i>

06:31.680 --> 06:33.440
Hey, Senpai.

06:33.520 --> 06:37.270
It'd be pretty bad if he found out
you were with a girl, huh?

06:37.520 --> 06:39.440
If you know that, then shut up, you dumbass!

06:39.520 --> 06:41.820
It's like some kind of fetish play! How fun!

06:41.900 --> 06:43.030
Is it getting you excited?

06:43.110 --> 06:44.200
<i>Akiteru-kun?</i>

06:44.280 --> 06:47.490
Oh, uh, my cat started smacking at my phone.

06:47.570 --> 06:49.080
Hey! Cut it out!

06:49.160 --> 06:52.160
<i>Sounds like it's pretty wild.</i>
<i>You'd better teach it to behave.</i>

06:52.250 --> 06:55.370
Yes, I'd love nothing more than
to discipline her thoroughly.

06:55.460 --> 06:56.630
This damn girl—

06:57.540 --> 06:58.880
I mean, cat!

06:59.750 --> 07:02.210
Who's the one being disciplined here?

07:03.590 --> 07:07.260
You're so cute when you're at my mercy!

07:07.720 --> 07:09.350
Don't tell me you're...

07:09.680 --> 07:10.930
No, I'm not!

07:11.060 --> 07:13.180
Come on! Behave yourself!

07:13.770 --> 07:15.310
Meow!

07:15.560 --> 07:18.730
What a cute meow. Take good care of her, okay?

07:18.810 --> 07:21.150
<i>Oops, time for my meeting.</i>

07:21.230 --> 07:24.110
<i>Anyway, I'm relieved to hear that</i>
<i>you don't have a girlfriend.</i>

07:24.570 --> 07:26.410
<i>I'll fill you in on my terms later.</i>

07:26.490 --> 07:27.990
<i>Well, bye!</i>

07:30.580 --> 07:32.330
He hung up.

07:34.160 --> 07:36.290
Do you know what you've done, you idiot?!

07:36.370 --> 07:40.710
Hey, Senpai, I'm thirsty.

07:43.050 --> 07:46.050
There's tomato juice
on the second shelf in the fridge.

07:46.130 --> 07:48.550
It's 100% real juice, rich and super healthy.

07:48.970 --> 07:51.560
Yay! That's my Senpai!

07:51.640 --> 07:55.230
The master of mindfulness!
I love you! I love you!

08:03.860 --> 08:05.740
<i>Life is short.</i>

08:06.030 --> 08:11.660
<i>Even as every breath we take</i>
<i>is another step closer to death,</i>

08:11.950 --> 08:14.660
<i>high school kids these days</i>
<i>haven't a care in the world.</i>

08:15.040 --> 08:18.790
<i>But I'm using my limited time</i>
<i>in this life efficiently.</i>

08:18.870 --> 08:20.670
<i>I can't waste a single minute.</i>

08:21.210 --> 08:24.670
<i>I need to do all I can to secure my future.</i>

08:29.550 --> 08:30.640
Hey, you dropped this.

08:30.720 --> 08:32.550
Whoa, you scared me!

08:32.640 --> 08:34.850
I didn't even realize you were there, Ohboshi!

08:34.930 --> 08:37.810
Uh, ouch. I've been here this whole time.

08:37.890 --> 08:40.770
S-Sorry, man. I didn't mean anything by it.

08:45.780 --> 08:48.240
- Long day, huh, Aki?
- Yeah.

08:49.950 --> 08:51.910
Here. I copied the notes.

08:51.990 --> 08:53.490
I appreciate it.

08:53.580 --> 08:54.950
<i>Kohinata Ozuma.</i>

08:55.040 --> 08:58.710
<i>My one and only best friend,</i>
<i>and my chosen ride-or-die for life.</i>

08:59.330 --> 09:01.420
Let me buy you some anmitsu later.

09:01.500 --> 09:03.090
You prefer traditional desserts, right?

09:03.170 --> 09:06.710
Really? It wasn't any trouble at all.

09:06.800 --> 09:09.630
Nah, I impose on you all the time.

09:09.720 --> 09:11.800
You gotta let me pay you back a little.

09:12.140 --> 09:15.180
You're... such a nice guy.

09:15.260 --> 09:16.600
So dramatic.

09:16.680 --> 09:20.100
For a guy who's all about min-maxing life,
you sure wear your heart on your sleeve.

09:20.190 --> 09:22.400
I'm not going to lie about my own emotions.

09:22.480 --> 09:23.730
Weirdo.

09:23.810 --> 09:27.400
But hey, it's that human side of you
that makes you so <i>you</i>.

09:27.490 --> 09:30.490
Don't get me wrong.
Everything I do is calculated.

09:31.450 --> 09:35.830
But the fact that you include us
in your calculations is sweet.

09:36.540 --> 09:38.790
And then there's my sister, of course.

09:38.870 --> 09:41.460
Oh, she went to your place
again yesterday, yeah?

09:41.540 --> 09:45.380
- Yeah.
- You know, I think she likes you.

09:45.460 --> 09:46.670
What?

09:46.750 --> 09:47.920
Not a chance.

09:48.050 --> 09:51.470
She just gets a kick out of messing with me.

09:51.550 --> 09:53.390
Maybe it's her way of showing affection.

09:53.680 --> 09:55.680
There's that dumb urban legend again.

09:55.760 --> 09:58.560
If she liked me, it would make
absolutely no sense to torment me

09:58.640 --> 10:01.310
at the risk of making me hate her.

10:01.730 --> 10:05.270
I'm pretty sure that's not
how girls think, though.

10:05.560 --> 10:09.780
There's not much to like about
an average guy like me, anyway.

10:09.860 --> 10:12.200
I think you're pretty popular, actually.

10:12.280 --> 10:15.370
Coming from a hottie like you,
that just sounds like a dig.

10:18.410 --> 10:20.950
Pigs who cannot respect our time

10:21.370 --> 10:23.920
need to pack up and leave right now.

10:23.100 --> 10:24.960
Oink!

10:25.080 --> 10:26.840
<i>Our homeroom and math teacher,</i>

10:26.920 --> 10:30.010
<i>Kageishi Sumire, A.K.A. "the Venomous Queen."</i>

10:30.090 --> 10:32.470
Okay, we're starting homeroom.

10:33.430 --> 10:35.680
<i>Look at that patronizing face.</i>

10:37.800 --> 10:39.760
O-O-O-O-Ohboshi!

10:39.850 --> 10:42.930
S-S-S-Someone's here to s-s-s-see you!

10:43.850 --> 10:45.940
It's a girl! A super-cute one!

10:46.060 --> 10:47.810
She's a first-year, right?

10:47.900 --> 10:49.440
Ohboshi-senpai!

10:49.530 --> 10:50.440
Gah.

10:51.320 --> 10:54.200
What the hell are you doing here?

10:54.280 --> 10:57.320
I needed to talk to you, obviously.

10:58.120 --> 11:02.830
Don't be creepy. Just act
all hyper like you always do.

11:02.910 --> 11:05.830
Huh? What are you talking about?

11:06.250 --> 11:07.790
<i>This little...</i>

11:07.880 --> 11:12.800
<i>She puts on this smart, polite,</i>
<i>wholesome act at school.</i>

11:13.090 --> 11:15.760
Senpai, let's go home together.

11:15.840 --> 11:18.140
Wait here. I'll get my stuff.

11:18.220 --> 11:19.640
And I'll get Ozuma.

11:19.720 --> 11:21.930
Oh... We don't need my brother.

11:22.020 --> 11:23.270
Huh? Why not?

11:23.640 --> 11:26.400
Jeez, don't make me say it out loud.

11:26.480 --> 11:29.270
I want it to be just the two of us.

11:29.360 --> 11:31.530
D-Don't make your voice sound like that!

11:31.610 --> 11:34.360
You're gonna do things to my heart
when you don't mean to!

11:34.650 --> 11:37.160
What? How could you say that?

11:37.240 --> 11:39.120
Aren't you and I a couple?!

11:39.200 --> 11:40.280
What?!

11:40.370 --> 11:43.250
Just yesterday, we expressed our
love for each other so intensely!

11:43.330 --> 11:45.750
You're confusing "exchanging love"
for "exchanging blows!"

11:45.830 --> 11:49.170
How can you be so cruel?!
Were just playing games with me?!

11:50.250 --> 11:51.630
What's up, Aki?

11:51.710 --> 11:53.420
Huh? Iroha?

11:53.510 --> 11:56.090
Oh, Onii-chan. I hope you had a nice day.

11:56.170 --> 11:59.600
You see, Ohboshi-senpai and
I are actually going out.

11:59.680 --> 12:01.050
Um...

12:01.140 --> 12:03.770
Oh, damn it! This is out of control!

12:04.270 --> 12:06.850
Okay, Iroha, you come with me for a minute!

12:07.520 --> 12:08.690
Whee!

12:10.480 --> 12:13.110
Um...

12:13.650 --> 12:16.240
What the hell are you trying to pull?

12:16.320 --> 12:19.570
I mean, we're basically dating, aren't we?

12:19.660 --> 12:21.580
Enough of that!

12:21.950 --> 12:25.080
You said it'd be a problem
if you had a girlfriend.

12:26.620 --> 12:28.830
Oh, is this about that phone call yesterday?

12:28.920 --> 12:31.420
So I figured I'd be your girlfriend!

12:32.170 --> 12:37.800
I mean, I know it's kind of unrealistic
since I'm way out of your league,

12:37.880 --> 12:41.090
and that if you bragged about it,
you'd come across as delusional...

12:41.180 --> 12:43.390
But I'm the one making the offer!

12:43.470 --> 12:45.770
And you think that makes it more convincing?

12:46.140 --> 12:47.770
Yes, exactly!

12:47.850 --> 12:49.520
Give me a break, would you?

12:51.020 --> 12:53.230
My future's on the line here.

12:53.320 --> 12:54.900
Don't interfere.

12:59.740 --> 13:02.450
You're way too dense, Senpai.

13:02.820 --> 13:05.200
Why can't you see it?

13:05.290 --> 13:06.870
Wh-What are you doing?

13:07.200 --> 13:10.710
I just... want you to look my way.

13:11.380 --> 13:13.420
That's why I pick on you all the time.

13:14.960 --> 13:18.420
I know you're serious about your future,

13:18.510 --> 13:21.590
but you're so fixated on something
so far off in the distance

13:21.680 --> 13:24.600
that you won't even look at
what's right under your nose.

13:24.680 --> 13:28.730
Isn't it natural to feel sad about that?

13:28.810 --> 13:29.980
Iroha?

13:30.690 --> 13:34.690
Don't leave me behind. I want us
to be close forever and ever.

13:35.230 --> 13:38.860
- I want what we have to last forever.
<i>- What's with her? Why say all this now?</i>

13:38.940 --> 13:42.200
- So... So please...
<i>- What... What am I supposed to do?!</i>

13:43.110 --> 13:44.700
Gotcha!

13:45.370 --> 13:48.410
Did you get your hopes up? I bet you did!

13:48.790 --> 13:52.960
I've always wanted to try an
authentic confession scene like that!

13:53.040 --> 13:55.420
I knew it'd be the cutest thing ever
if you got all flustered,

13:55.500 --> 13:58.710
since you usually don't even see me as a girl!

13:58.800 --> 14:00.220
Well? How'd you feel?

14:00.970 --> 14:04.550
Oh, you're too embarrassed
to even say anything?

14:04.640 --> 14:07.180
Look at you! You're red
all the way to your ears!

14:07.260 --> 14:08.930
Silly Senpai!

14:09.560 --> 14:13.690
You! Are! So! Cute!

14:13.980 --> 14:17.270
I'm never going to believe
a word you say again,

14:17.360 --> 14:19.480
you garbage female!

14:20.030 --> 14:24.950
- Whee! Run away!
- Hold still! You're not getting away!

14:25.030 --> 14:28.030
MY FRIEND'S LITTLE SISTER HAS IT IN FOR ME!

14:29.370 --> 14:30.910
Thanks for coming all the way out here.

14:31.500 --> 14:32.750
No, I should be thanking you.

14:33.330 --> 14:35.250
I know you're very busy.

14:37.880 --> 14:40.840
Oh, actually, there's someone else with me,

14:40.920 --> 14:44.680
but why don't you and I talk
things over alone first?

14:44.760 --> 14:45.930
Okay.

14:46.300 --> 14:48.010
THE NIGHT THE BLACK GOAT SCREAMED
- You surprised me.

14:48.100 --> 14:51.930
I had no idea you'd designed and
released a game on your own already.

14:52.270 --> 14:55.480
I didn't do it alone. It was a team effort.

14:56.150 --> 14:57.770
05th Floor Alliance.

14:57.860 --> 14:59.400
Programmer: Oz.

14:59.480 --> 15:01.900
Illustrator: Murasaki Shikibu-sensei.

15:01.990 --> 15:03.950
Scenario: Makigai Namako.

15:04.030 --> 15:07.320
The so-called "Mysterious
Voice Actor Brigade X."

15:07.410 --> 15:10.490
And the producer and director: Aki.

15:10.870 --> 15:12.410
In other words, you.

15:12.500 --> 15:15.250
We work together as a team.

15:15.870 --> 15:18.460
Without any one of us,
this game wouldn't exist.

15:18.790 --> 15:19.840
Sure.

15:19.920 --> 15:21.800
It's the talk of the industry right now.

15:21.880 --> 15:24.300
The mysterious creator team
that showed up out of nowhere,

15:24.380 --> 15:28.140
built a reputation purely through word of mouth,
and broke one million downloads.

15:28.220 --> 15:30.310
We still have a long way to go, though.

15:30.850 --> 15:34.060
Everything HPW puts out automatically
gets over a million downloads.

15:34.560 --> 15:37.230
It's nonsensical to compare yourself
to big business like us.

15:39.150 --> 15:42.730
You have a small team that's
found a way to be competitive.

15:43.190 --> 15:46.950
I don't know if I could've done
the same when I was in school.

15:47.030 --> 15:49.240
And it's a game worthy of its popularity.

15:49.530 --> 15:53.240
So... what are the terms
you spoke of the other day?

15:53.700 --> 15:57.370
Right. Let's order first.
Have whatever you like.

15:57.460 --> 16:00.080
<i>He said someone else</i>
<i>would be joining us, didn't he?</i>

16:00.170 --> 16:02.800
<i>An on-site hiring manager?</i>

16:02.880 --> 16:04.300
<i>And what are his terms?</i>

16:04.760 --> 16:10.140
<i>I'm glad I brought a proposal</i>
<i>in case he brought up the game.</i>

16:10.470 --> 16:12.510
And the drink bar for both of us.

16:13.010 --> 16:15.930
- Actually, could you add a third person?
- Of course.

16:16.560 --> 16:20.100
- You have such lovely fingers.
<i>- Huh?</i>

16:20.190 --> 16:21.650
U-Um...

16:21.730 --> 16:23.360
Would you care to meet up after our dinner?

16:23.440 --> 16:27.820
Perhaps my heart's passenger seat has
remained open for the day I met you.

16:28.200 --> 16:31.200
I'm on the clock, sir! Please excuse me!

16:33.540 --> 16:36.290
Uncle, you probably shouldn't have done that.

16:36.370 --> 16:39.080
People won't know you like them
unless you tell them.

16:39.170 --> 16:42.170
Being tsundere only works in anime.

16:42.250 --> 16:43.590
True enough.

16:44.300 --> 16:45.590
There. See?

16:46.880 --> 16:49.800
If that's her reaction to the first try,
I can win her over in two more.

16:50.090 --> 16:52.140
<i>This guy's an actual creep.</i>

16:52.720 --> 16:55.770
<i>Oh, crap! I'm slipping out of suck-up mode!</i>

16:56.100 --> 16:57.850
May I take a bathroom break?

16:57.940 --> 16:59.270
Sure, go ahead.

17:01.400 --> 17:06.110
<i>I'll hypnotize myself into believing I didn't</i>
<i>just see an old lech hitting on a waitress.</i>

17:06.190 --> 17:08.280
UNISEX RESTROOM - LOCK IS BROKEN, PLEASE KNOCK
<i>- I'm the president's lapdog.</i>

17:08.780 --> 17:10.490
<i>I'm the president's lapdog.</i>

17:11.530 --> 17:13.410
<i>I'm the president's lapdog...</i>

17:27.210 --> 17:30.970
What's up, Kohinata? Not going home yet?

17:31.930 --> 17:35.220
It's so boring without Senpai here today.

17:35.510 --> 17:37.430
I don't have anyone to pick on.

17:37.930 --> 17:39.350
Hm...

17:39.730 --> 17:41.350
What's going on between you two, anyway?

17:41.440 --> 17:46.900
Nothing! Nothing ever happens between us!

17:46.980 --> 17:49.150
I see. Nothing, huh?

17:50.450 --> 17:52.030
So... who is this?

17:53.910 --> 17:56.240
What? You don't remember?

17:56.660 --> 18:00.160
You came over and played with her
all the time when you were little.

18:00.750 --> 18:02.370
Wait, is that...

18:02.830 --> 18:03.880
Mashiro?

18:04.380 --> 18:06.170
<i>Tsukinomori Mashiro.</i>

18:06.250 --> 18:09.210
<i>My uncle's daughter, and my cousin.</i>

18:10.380 --> 18:13.890
<i>I think she goes to some</i>
<i>prestigious all-girls school in the city.</i>

18:14.180 --> 18:16.680
What's Mashiro doing here, though?

18:17.100 --> 18:19.020
I brought her along.

18:20.060 --> 18:25.730
It has to do with my terms for hiring
05th Floor Alliance as employees of HPW.

18:26.860 --> 18:31.400
I want you to be Mashiro's
fake boyfriend until you graduate.

18:33.030 --> 18:35.780
Um... You want me to be what, now?

18:35.870 --> 18:36.870
Her fake boyfriend.

18:36.950 --> 18:38.740
Wha... What?!

18:38.830 --> 18:41.540
This doesn't make sense. Are you crazy?

18:41.620 --> 18:44.500
Why do I have to go through such torture?

18:45.920 --> 18:47.880
Stop being so selfish!

18:48.290 --> 18:51.720
Just granting your wish to transfer
from a prestigious all-girls school

18:51.800 --> 18:53.840
to a co-ed public school broke my heart!

18:53.930 --> 18:56.850
Is it so outrageous for me
to give you a bodyguard

18:56.930 --> 19:01.310
so those lecherous monsters
don't come after you?!

19:01.390 --> 19:04.850
I don't know how you got from there
to the whole fake boyfriend scheme.

19:04.940 --> 19:05.940
I refuse.

19:06.060 --> 19:08.440
She's transferring to my school?

19:08.520 --> 19:10.940
Yes, it's all been arranged.

19:11.030 --> 19:12.530
But why so suddenly?

19:12.990 --> 19:14.450
- Well...
- D-Don't!

19:14.820 --> 19:16.410
Don't tell Aki.

19:16.990 --> 19:19.080
You know I have to tell him.

19:23.370 --> 19:27.380
The thing is, Mashiro has barely
attended high school at all.

19:27.960 --> 19:29.880
So she's truant?

19:32.170 --> 19:34.930
Well, to be frank, yes.

19:36.720 --> 19:40.720
If I explained why, though,
we'd be here all night.

19:41.470 --> 19:42.930
I don't need to know.

19:43.930 --> 19:46.060
She became truant due to events in her past,

19:46.140 --> 19:48.860
but she decided to transfer
because she wants to change, right?

19:50.270 --> 19:53.110
That's all the information I need.

19:53.190 --> 19:58.200
I'm all about efficiency,
so I won't pry or interfere unnecessarily.

19:58.660 --> 20:02.830
If I were to seek any further info,
it'd be out of pure, lowbrow curiosity.

20:02.910 --> 20:03.950
Aki...

20:04.200 --> 20:06.210
That's a good philosophy.

20:06.290 --> 20:09.580
I understand the circumstances
and your concern.

20:10.130 --> 20:13.710
And that this is a non-negotiable condition
for my employment at HPW.

20:14.590 --> 20:16.720
That's right. Absolutely non-negotiable.

20:17.010 --> 20:18.760
Then I accept.

20:20.550 --> 20:23.140
And what do you say, Mashiro?

20:27.230 --> 20:29.270
As long as it's fake, it's fine.

20:30.440 --> 20:33.270
You did say I had to accept
your terms to transfer.

20:33.650 --> 20:36.240
To be honest, I hate the idea, but...

20:37.400 --> 20:39.910
In that case, we have a deal.

20:41.280 --> 20:43.080
Let's make this work, Mashiro.

20:44.660 --> 20:46.200
Don't get all friendly with me!

20:46.290 --> 20:47.660
Pervert! Freak!

20:47.750 --> 20:50.750
Remember, this is fake!
We're not going to be friends!

20:52.210 --> 20:54.300
Okay, fine with me, I guess.

20:55.800 --> 20:57.760
Looks like you'll get along great!

20:58.180 --> 21:00.380
What in the world gives you that idea?

21:00.470 --> 21:04.010
For real. I think your eyes are giving out.

21:04.720 --> 21:07.310
See? You're in perfect sync!

21:07.680 --> 21:10.190
- Oh, right. Akiteru-kun...
- Yes?

21:10.270 --> 21:12.810
You are strictly her <i>fake</i> boyfriend.

21:12.900 --> 21:16.190
Should you make any actual moves on Mashiro...

21:17.280 --> 21:18.780
I'm sure I don't need to explain.

21:19.280 --> 21:20.950
No need to worry.

21:21.030 --> 21:24.080
Mashiro seems to hate my guts, anyway.

21:24.910 --> 21:29.410
<i>Someone who's cold and harsh</i>
<i>towards you actually likes you?</i>

21:29.500 --> 21:31.420
<i>There's no way that can be true.</i>

21:31.960 --> 21:37.420
<i>So why am I surrounded by so many</i>
<i>women who are just that aggravating?</i>

21:37.710 --> 21:40.300
Well, then, you can start tomorrow,

21:40.380 --> 21:42.010
fake boyfriend.

21:42.930 --> 21:44.010
Yes, sir.

21:47.020 --> 21:49.850
MY FRIEND'S LITTLE SISTER HAS IT IN FOR ME!
<i>- Looks like I've got my work cut out for me.</i>

21:49.930 --> 21:51.020
MY FRIEND'S LITTLE SISTER HAS IT IN FOR ME!

23:21.110 --> 23:26.070
BETTER WATCH NEXT TIME, TOO... MEOW
